     <div class=\"games-item__content\">\n        <p class=\"games-item__content-text\">Discover TropicVille! A forgotten seaside town is waiting for you — turn it\n          into a true tropical paradise!</p>\n        <a class=\"games-item__content-button\"\n          href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.tapclap.merge.tropicville&pli=1\" target=\"_blank\">play\n          game</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"games-item games-item--mansiontale\">\n      <div class=\"games-item__content\">\n        <p class=\"games-item__content-text\">Can you uncover the secrets hidden in the old mansion? Discover all the\n          merging secrets with Ashley!</p>\n        <a class=\"games-item__content-button\" href=\"https://mansiontale.com/\" target=\"_blank\">play game</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"games-item__image\">\n        <img src=\"../../img/games/mansionTale.png\" alt=\"mansionTale\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"games-item\">\n      <div class=\"games-item__image\">\n        <img src=\"../../img/games/designville.png\" alt=\"designville\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"games-item__content\">\n        <p class=\"games-item__content-text\">Make your dream come true:<br>build and expand the biggest and best remodel\n          studio in DesignVille!</p>\n        <a class=\"games-item__content-button\" href=\"https://designville.games\" target=\"_blank\">play game</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"games-item\">\n      <div class=\"games-item__content\">\n        <p class=\"games-item__content-text\">Needlework has never been so exciting, fun and convenient! Play the game and\n          become a real cross stitch master!</p>\n        <a class=\"games-item__content-button\" href=\"https://cross-stitch-masters.com\" target=\"_blank\">play game</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"games-item__image\">\n        <img src=\"../../img/games/crossstich.png\" alt=\"crossstich\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"games-item\">\n      <div class=\"games-item__image\">\n        <img src=\"../../img/games/candyvalley.png\" alt=\"candyvalley\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"games-item__content\">\n        <p class=\"games-item__content-text\">Your sweet journey through Candy Valley begins here, and you'll love every\n          minute of it.</p>\n        <a class=\"games-item__content-button\" href=\"https://candyvalley.games\" target=\"_blank\">play game</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"games-item\">\n      <div class=\"games-item__content\">\n        <p class=\"games-item__content-text\">Yo-ho-ho! Do you love treasure, engaging levels, and fun tasks? Then join\n          us!</p>\n        <a class=\"games-item__content-button\" href=\"https://piratetreasures.com\" target=\"_blank\">play game</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"games-item__image\">\n        <img src=\"../../img/games/pirate.png\" alt=\"pirate\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n        </main>\n        <footer class=\"footer\">\n            <section class=\"contacts wrapper\" id=\"contacts\">\n    <h2 class=\"games-title\">Contacts</h2>\n    <ul class=\"contacts-list\">\n        <li class=\"contacts-item contacts-item--support\">\n            <h3 class=\"contacts-item__title\">Technical support:</h3>\n            <a class=\"contacts-item__mail\" href=\"mailto:support@tapclap.com\">support@tapclap.com</a>\n            <p class=\"contacts-item__text\">Contact us if you're having problems with one of our games. If you need an answer quickly, send us a message in the game's social network groups.</p>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"contacts-item contacts-item--job\">\n            <h3 class=\"contacts-item__title\">For resumes:</h3>\n            <a class=\"contacts-item__mail\" href=\"mailto:job@tapclap.com\">job@tapclap.com</a>\n            <p class=\"contacts-item__text\">We're looking for talented and ambitious specialists that share our love for top-notch games. Join us and become part of our successful team!</p>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"contacts-item contacts-item--hello\">\n            <h3 class=\"contacts-item__title\">Other issues:</h3>\n            <a class=\"contacts-item__mail\" href=\"mailto:hello@tapclap.com\">hello@tapclap.com</a>\n            <p class=\"contacts-item__text\">For questions about advertising and other partnerships, or to get more information about the company, please contact us.</p>\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n    <div class=\"contacts-footer\">\n        <div class=\"contacts-footer__links\">\n            <a href=\"../../privacy-policy-en.html\">privacy policy</a>\n            <a href=\"../../terms-of-service-en.html\">terms and conditions</a>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"social-list\">\n            <li class=\"social-item social-item__fb\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/tapclapgames/\" target=\"_blank\"></a>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"social-item social-item__inst\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/tapclapgames/\" target=\"_blank\"></a>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"social-item social-item__in\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/tapclap/\" target=\"_blank\"></a>\n            </li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n        </footer>\n    </body>\n    <script async src=\"/js/main.js\"></script>\n\n</html>\n",
